USE estimate-template.flow
USE estimate-rules.flow
USE estimate-draft-rules.flow
USE ../knowledge/common-knowledge.flow
USE ../knowledge/tool-knowledge.flow

DO Resolve the canonical project and active ticket from @request or conversation,
    and select the draft under @draft_rules. Reject mismatches and retain local
    task identity. Return an object with project, ticket_id (NULL if unknown),
    ticket (complete matching cached Jira object or NULL), path, and text
    (both NULL for a new draft). AS state

IF @state.ticket_id == NULL
    ASK "Which Jira ticket should this estimate use?" AS ticket_input

    DO Validate @ticket_input as one Jira ID against the current task and draft
        association. Bind an unassigned draft, retain task identity, and return
        @state updated with that ID. AS state

IF @state.ticket == NULL
    DO Resolve private absolute acli using @tool_guidance. Return its path. AS acli

    RUN @acli jira workitem view @state.ticket_id --fields "key,issuetype,summary,status,assignee,description,attachment" --json
    AS ticket_result

    DO Parse @ticket_result.stdout as JSON. Verify its key equals @state.ticket_id
        and requested details are complete. Retain the full ticket and project.
        Return @state updated with that ticket object. AS state

DO Assess expected behavior from @state.ticket, relevant workflow, code,
    coverage, and team scoring guidance once. Reuse current evidence; searches must affect the estimate.
    Resolve scope-changing ambiguity from Jira comments or attachments only as
    needed, following @tool_guidance. Do not run tests. Return an object with
    scope, evidence, scoring_guidance, assumptions, risks, and Boolean blocked
    (required information is missing). AS analysis

IF @analysis.blocked == TRUE
    ASK "What is the missing scope or behavior needed for this estimate?" AS clarification

    DO Apply @clarification to @analysis and reassess. Return the updated object. AS analysis

    IF @analysis.blocked == TRUE
        RETURN "Estimate generation stopped because required information is still missing."

DO Generate the complete estimate for @state.ticket_id and @request from
    @estimate_template, @state.text, and @analysis using @estimate_rules and
    @writing_guidance. Preserve supported developer decisions. Return the text. AS draft

DO Validate the complete @draft against @estimate_template and @estimate_rules.

DO Save and verify @draft under @draft_rules, using @state.path when present
    and @state.text as the concurrent-edit baseline. Recheck the active project
    and ticket against @state.project and @state.ticket_id. Return the saved path. AS draft_path

PRINT Report @state.ticket_id, saved SP, @draft_path, and material assumptions or risks briefly.
